          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Bring classic elegance and long-term performance to your project with our 6\" Copper Half-Round Gutter System. Built for durability and timeless appeal, this system is ideal for both residential and light commercial buildings. Whether you're restoring a historic home or upgrading your current setup, copper offers unmatched longevity and a natural patina that gets better with time. Order exactly what you need—gutter lengths, downspouts, hangers, and all the essential accessories, right here in one place.</p>"
